an><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This is a disambiguation page, which links to ambiguously named articles. If you were <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Perform_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Perform (disambiguation)\">brought here</a> by a link in an article, consider editing it to direct towards the intended page instead.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Perform</b> is a set of actions that allows characters with <a href=\"/wiki/Musical_instrument\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Musical instrument\">musical instruments</a> to play songs and attract the attention of nearby NPCs. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"By_musical_instrument\">By musical instrument</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Drum)\" title=\"Perform (Drum)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Perform_Drum_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Drum_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Perform_Drum_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_Drum_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Perform_Drum_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Drum_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Drum)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Perform_Drum_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Drum_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Perform_Drum_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Drum)\" title=\"Perform (Drum)\">Perform (Drum)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Flute)\" title=\"Perform (Flute)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Perform_Flute_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Flute_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Perform_Flute_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_Flute_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Perform_Flute_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Flute_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Flute)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Perform_Flute_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Flute_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Perform_Flute_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Flute)\" title=\"Perform (Flute)\">Perform (Flute)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Lute)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\">Perform (Lute)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)\" title=\"Perform (Lyre)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Lyre)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)\" title=\"Perform (Lyre)\">Perform (Lyre)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Violin)\" title=\"Perform (Violin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Violin)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Violin)\" title=\"Perform (Violin)\">Perform (Violin)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Whistle)\" title=\"Perform (Whistle)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Whistle)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Perform_Whistle_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Whistle)\" title=\"Perform (Whistle)\">Perform (Whistle)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/30px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/45px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/60px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/30px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\">Play the Spider's Lyre</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"By_song\">By song</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27\" title=\"Perform 'Bard Dance'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Bard Dance'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Bard_Dance%27\" title=\"Perform 'Bard Dance'\">Perform 'Bard Dance'</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27\" title=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27\" title=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\">Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27\" title=\"Perform 'Old Time Battles'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Old Time Battles'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27\" title=\"Perform 'Old Time Battles'\">Perform 'Old Time Battles'</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Power%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Power'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'The Power'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Perform_%27The_Power%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Power%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Power'\">Perform 'The Power'</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\">Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27\" title=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/45px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27\" title=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\">Perform 'Sing for Me'</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If multiple characters use the Perform action, they sync up and play together. Also nearby bards, such as in the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a>, can join the performance.\n<ul><li>If multiple characters perform the same song, the individual instruments can be heard together as the song is played (e.g., <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\">lute</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\">violin</a>).</li>\n<li>Multiple instruments are more easily heard if ambient volume in the game's audio settings is moved to or near zero.\n<ul><li>A harmonious example of multiple instruments can occur after Ketheric Thorm's defeat, when a player character on the violin joins Alfira on her lute to perform for the tiefling children.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Nearby NPCs gather to hear the performance and focus their attention on the performer(s). This can create an opportunity for pickpocketing and thievery. Many patrolling NPCs cannot be distracted this way.</li>\n<li>If the performer has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency#Instrument_proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">musical instrument proficiency</a>, they make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/38px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/50px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> check. If successful, the gathered audience tips the performer with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/30px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/40px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toss a Coin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\">Toss a Coin</a> when the performance ends. However, a successful performance does not necessarily result in every attendee tipping the performer(s).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> of the performance check scales with the size of the audience:\n<ul><li>1 audience member: DC 10</li>\n<li>2-3 audience members: DC 12</li>\n<li>4-5 audience members: DC 15</li>\n<li>6-7 audience members: DC 18</li>\n<li>8+ audience members: DC 20</li></ul></li>\n<li>Any character can use the Perform action with an instrument equipped. However, a character without instrument proficiency makes a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poor Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\">Poor Performance</a> when doing so. This provokes annoyed reactions from the audience who will leave immediately.</li>\n<li>Perform is a free action, and can be used during battle. The performance ends if the performing character is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>.</li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195719\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5023/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40583/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6569/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.066/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1323406/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   82.933      1 -total\n 36.49%   30.262     13 Template:MdSAI\n 33.81%   28.036     17 Template:Icon_link\n 32.15%   26.659     17 Template:Icon_text\n 29.13%   24.158      1 Template:Disambig\n 28.68%   23.783      1 Template:Ambox\n 27.37%   22.700     47 Template:Trim\n 16.19%   13.430      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 13.56%   11.245      2 Template:Item_icon\n 11.97%    9.925      2 Template:SmCond\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:41672-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195719 and revision id 393136. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}